WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.728
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:21.184
Open the attendance controls. Expand Attendance and confirm the selected child belongs to the teacher’s classroom.

00:00:21.184 --> 00:00:31.640
Review status choices. Choose only the status matching the child’s real attendance. This example prepares Absent without submitting it.

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:42.188
Distinguish status from an arrival or departure. Review the log type separately. A status selection and an actual check-in or check-out describe different facts.

00:00:42.188 --> 00:00:52.644
Review before saving. After an authorized update, verify the child card and the event time. This training form is not submitted.

